{"version":1,"content":"<p>美聯儲在周五發佈的金融穩定半年度報告中指出，人工智能和高企的資產估值可能帶來潛在脆弱性。「資產估值壓力持續高企。股權估值指標仍處於高位，部分源於市場對超級智能的狂熱，」美聯儲表示，並採用了總統當勞·特朗普偏愛的「AI」這一術語。該行補充道，這種狂熱已因對企業資本支出和債務發行計劃的擔憂而有所緩和。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586326.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T23:09:26.324485+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T22:50:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T23:02:33.144475+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T23:02:33.144475+00:00","content_hash":"e9a4f2fd4a8d1636a00706ce7e6dc10e8c5d191821a2b42f50f368aeb980710b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}